flowchart TD
    V[Simulated or watch vitals] --> S[Store timestamped sample]
    S --> M[Python watch worker detects flags and activity]
    M --> D[Apply configured rule response and record decision]
    D --> T{Response tier}

    T -->|Tier 1| A[Create cancellable dose proposal]
    A --> X{Reviewed quantity and stock available?}
    X -->|Yes, after cancel window| I[Record administration and decrement inventory]
    X -->|No| U[Mark dose unavailable and notify crew]
    A -->|Astronaut cancels in time| C[Cancel dose proposal]
    I --> H{Was the patient acting leader?}
    H -->|Yes| CH[Move command to next fit crew member and log handover]
    H -->|No| E[Monitor event]
    U --> E
    C --> E
    CH --> E

    T -->|Tier 2| P[Send dose decision to astronaut's decider]
    P -->|Approve with reviewed dose and stock| PC[Ask astronaut to confirm]
    PC -->|Confirm| E
    P -->|Reject| E
    P -->|Wait 60 s| PE[Escalate that decision one position]

    T -->|Tier 3| N[Alert crew with first-response instructions]
    N -->|Decider approves, stock and dose available| G[Alerted crewmate records administration]
    N -->|Wait 60 s| G
    G --> E

    subgraph Daily health review
        SL[Sleep record] --> CI[Daily check-in]
        VH[24-hour vitals] --> CI
        MH[Mental-health answers] --> CI
        CI --> RC[Manager agent assesses root cause]
        RC --> TP[Save treatment plan and items]
        TP --> AP[Queue plan items for the astronaut's decider]
    end
    E --> CI

    subgraph Reports to mission command
        ER[Emergency report] --> Q{Earth link available?}
        WR[Acting leader creates weekly report] --> Q
        Q -->|No| OFF[Keep report queued]
        Q -->|Yes| SEND[Dispatch report and set Earth arrival time]
        OFF -->|Link restored| SEND
        SEND --> RT[Round-trip delay plus review interval]
        RT --> ACK[Store simulated acknowledgment]
    end
    E --> ER
